        {
          "chunk_id": "9515f411-8a05-454a-8fc6-0af417b6e92a",
          "text": "## Escalation\n\nThe on-call analyst classifies the incident using the service-level table. An urgent incident goes to the duty manager within 15 minutes of classification.",
