              "chunk_text": "---\ntitle: \"Cedar case-record retention (synthetic fixture)\"\ndate: 2026-10-12\ntype: evaluation-fixture\nstatus: frozen\ntags: [document-rag, synthetic]\nrelated:\n  - \"[Baseline protocol](/DOCS/evaluations/2026-10-12-document-rag-baseline.md)\"\n---\n\n# Cedar case-record retention \u2014 synthetic evaluation source\n\n## Current schedule\n\nUrgent case logs are retained for 180 days after closure.",
